{"unit_id":"mengqi1436__DSH-Rtk-rewrite#card-zh","repo":"mengqi1436/DSH-Rtk-rewrite","commit":"5de9afaa3e119a5dc351135abd63f12e2c46b2a2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pwsh-rtk-rewrite 是 DSH 桌面端 PowerShell shell 的命令改写插件。它通过 cordis patch 替换原有 pwsh 沙箱执行器，并在执行前调用 rtk rewrite 处理命令。主要功能包括改写受支持的命令、保留原执行参数、跳过已是 rtk 前缀的命令，以及在 rtk 不可用或没有改写结果时继续执行原命令。适合在 Windows PowerShell 环境中使用 DSH，并希望通过 rtk 获得紧凑命令输出的用户。需要 DSH、rtk ≥0.50.0 和 PowerShell；无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:5-15","index.js:135-156"]}
{"unit_id":"mengqi1436__DSH-Rtk-rewrite#card-en","repo":"mengqi1436/DSH-Rtk-rewrite","commit":"5de9afaa3e119a5dc351135abd63f12e2c46b2a2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pwsh-rtk-rewrite adds rtk rewriting to DSH's Windows PowerShell sandbox executor. It tries to rewrite commands before execution, skips existing rtk commands, and falls back to the original command when needed. Requires DSH, PowerShell and rtk 0.50.0 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:5-15","index.js:135-156"]}
